    "Wire-suffix/association comparison is derived with 51 higher constructors from prior defining square, pentagon and fusion naturality; it is not a new primitive.",
    "Every generated comparison has at most 52 higher constructors; exact support is the union of both competing step supports.",
    "Common-hole contextual lifting preserves the 52 bound and adds exactly placement needs to support.",
    "Updated checked-model endpoint repair preserves arbitrary correlated context, shared state and input in the joint law."
  ],
